* ES-6 fixture: SELECT with cursor loop and LOOP terminator (reporting mode)
* Valid Natural embedded SQL with loop body, demonstrating:
* - SELECT with INTO targets, FROM table, WHERE host-vars
* - Loop body with at least one statement
* - Terminated with LOOP (reporting mode) instead of END-SELECT

DEFINE DATA LOCAL
  1 #A (A10)
  1 #B (A10)
  1 #K (N5)
END-DEFINE

SELECT COL1, COL2 INTO #A, #B FROM EMPLOYEES WHERE DEPT = :#K
  PERFORM REPORT-EMP
LOOP

END
